### Test API Dashboard Stats
# Questo file può essere usato per testare l'endpoint delle statistiche

### GET Dashboard Stats - Default (30 giorni)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/ingressi/stats
Accept: application/json

### GET Dashboard Stats - 60 giorni
GET http://localhost:3000/api/ingressi/stats?period=60
Accept: application/json

### GET Dashboard Stats - 7 giorni
GET http://localhost:3000/api/ingressi/stats?period=7
Accept: application/json

###
